# Keep the Docker build context lean. The AOT build does an explicit
# `dotnet restore`/`publish`, so none of these are needed in-context — and
# shipping them bloats the context + is a needless IP-leak surface on the
# closed-Pro-IP image.
.git
.github
**/bin
**/obj
tests
docs
local-nuget-feed
*.log
**/soak-reports
**/*.user
.vs
.vscode
.idea
**/TestResults
**/.DS_Store
